run-mate-script-runner.groups.markdownDescription:
Groups of scripts that start with one click, **shared with your team**. Put this in `.vscode/settings.json` of the repository and commit it: everyone who uses RunMate gets the same group buttons.

You do not have to write this by hand. Make a group in the script list (the **+** button), then click the people icon on the group's row: RunMate writes it here for you.

Example:

```json
[
  {
    "name": "dev all",
    "scripts": [
      { "path": "apps/web", "script": "dev" },
      { "path": "apps/api", "script": "dev" }
    ]
  }
]
```
